  "downloads": 7152,
  "favourites_count": 0,
  "description": "<p>Original mod by Clog! <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2047-coyote-trader/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Coyote Trader</a></p>\n<p>An update to Coyote to 3.9.X, including (hopefully) fixing the quests to work on the new Ground Zero High Level (sandbox_high).</p>\n<p>Let me know if there’s any bugs and I’ll try to squash them.</p>\n<p>Installation follows the normal way, drag the user file in, make sure you download VCQL from the dependencies.</p>\n",
